data: {"id": "3e33945458ae4832-final", "run_id": "3e33945458ae4832", "seq": 1748, "ts_ms": 1789090605981, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc` | NotReady | Pod配置了环境变量FAILURE_MODE=readiness_fail，导致应用进程主动返回503状态码，引发Readiness Probe持续失败，使Pod处于NotReady状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Pod Status | `phase: Running`, `Ready: False` (`ContainersNotReady`), `restart_count: 0` | 确认应用进程存活但未就绪，排除了容器崩溃重启导致的间歇性故障。 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubelet | `Readiness probe failed: HTTP probe failed with statuscode: 503` (连续发生1246次) | 直接揭示探针检测到的核心症状为持续的服务端拒绝。 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | `http_status: 503`, `message: \"dependency unavailable\"`, `path: /work`, `first: 01:33:15.530Z` | 确认应用内部返回了503，且伴随“依赖不可用”的业务错误日志。 |\n| 4 | Tracing | Deepflow L7 Flow | `GET /work`, `dst_ip: 172.16.104.16` (Pod IP), `response_code: 503` (发生9次) | 证实外部请求到达Pod并成功收到503响应，排除了网络中断。 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Tempo Span | `http.response.status_code: 503`, `http.route: /work`, `aiops.observed_mode: readiness_fail` | 提供应用端观察到的模式标识，将业务逻辑错误直接关联到探针响应。 |\n\n**证据关系说明：**\n1. **应用侧与探针侧一致**：日志（#3）与 Trace（#4）确认应用本身主动返回了503状态码（`/work` 端点）；Kubelet 事件（#2）确认探针正是针对该503状态判定失败，二者互为因果印证。\n2. **进程存活与探针失败共存**：Pod 处于 `Running` 状态且未重启（#1），说明应用进程并未因 OOM 或 Crash 而退出，而是稳定地进入了“拒绝服务”的逻辑分支。\n3. **模式证据支持**：Trace 中的 `aiops.observed_mode: readiness_fail`（#5）从业务逻辑角度解释了为何服务返回503。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n环境变量配置 FAILURE_MODE=readiness_fail → 应用进程将 /ready 与 /work 等端点配置为主动返回 HTTP 503 → Kubelet 周期性探测 /ready 获取 503 状态码 → Pod 被 kubelet 判定为 ContainersNotReady 并持续标记为 NotReady\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：**应用被配置在故障模式（FAILURE_MODE=readiness_fail），导致健康检查端点主动返回 503 错误。**\n\n- **证据支撑**：Pod 状态显示进程持续存活但未就绪（`K8s State` #1）；Kubelet 连续报出探针收到 503 状态码（`K8s Event` #2）；日志与链路追踪均证实应用主动返回 503 状态及“依赖不可用”日志，且链路追踪明确标记了 `aiops.observed_mode: readiness_fail`（`Tracing` #4, #5）。\n- **结论**：Pod 处于 `NotReady` 并非由资源耗尽、网络中断或应用崩溃引起，而是应用内部逻辑主动触发的受控故障表现。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 166.1s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc: 166.1s (Evidence 157.3s, RCA 8.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-5mlnc**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 197.081, "metrics": {"run_id": "3e33945458ae4832", "mttr": {"value": "3.3m", "seconds": 197.09011030197144, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-notready-probe-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 197090.11030197144, "llm_calls": 20, "llm_duration_ms": 108425.37665367126, "tool_calls": 35, "executed_tool_calls": 28, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 7, "successful_tool_calls": 34, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 206555.04298210144, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 72157.9978466034}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19264.034509658813, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 166126.28364562988, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 11675.745248794556, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

